Builds against dcrecomp (https://github.com/sp00nznet/dcrecomp, GPL-2.0),
included as the dcrecomp/ submodule. Parts of dcrecomp's hardware layer are
derived from Flycast (GPL-2.0); dcrecomp's NOTICE lists them.

Before 2026-08-24 this repository carried its own copies of dcrecomp's HAL and
recompiler (src/hal/, src/recompiler/, include/, tools/static_recompile.py and
others). Those copies remain in history under GPL-2.0, for the same reason.

Crazy Taxi is (c) Sega. No game code or data is in this repository.
